Snake3: 2*(4+1)=2*5=10

Snake4:1*(10+1)=11. So max is 12.

Which matches the first line.

Similarly for k=2:

Snake1: 3*(3+2)=15

Snake2:5*(1+2)=15

Snake3:2*(4+2)=12

Snake4:1*(10+2)=12. Max is 15.

Sample output is correct.

